From: lavachemist <48248311+lavachemist@users.noreply.github.com>
Subject: [PATCH] input: rsinput: match the Retroid Pocket Duo's gamepad

The Duo's DTS (Retroid Pocket's eliza-retroidpocket-common.dtsi) names the
MCU "retroidpocket,rsinput", the compatible of Retroid's own rsinput driver
(retroid/patches/0010, left out: no rumble, no axis_* parameters). It uses
the same gamepad-* / vdd / enable-gpios properties as ROCKNIX's driver, so
ROCKNIX's driver (with 1003 rumble and our sleep patches) takes it too.

---
diff --git a/drivers/input/joystick/rsinput.c b/drivers/input/joystick/rsinput.c
--- a/drivers/input/joystick/rsinput.c
+++ b/drivers/input/joystick/rsinput.c
@@ -600,5 +600,6 @@
 static const struct of_device_id rsinput_of_match[] = {
     { .compatible = "gamepad,rsinput" },
+    { .compatible = "retroidpocket,rsinput" },
     { /* sentinel */ }
 };
